hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"67","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam Witr ke baad do rak'atein baith kar padhte the, jin mein ""Idha zulzilat al-ard..."" aur ""Qul ya ayyuhal kafirun"" tilawat farmate the."
"68","[AI-translation] Abu Madinah al-Darimi riwayat karte hain ke farmaya: Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke do sahabi jab aapas mein milte to juda nahi hote jab tak ke un mein se ek dusre par ""Wal-Asr, innal-insana lafi khusr"" na parh le, phir un mein se ek dusre ko salam karta."
"69","[AI-translation] Farwah bin Nawfal se, apne waalid se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne Nawfal se farmaya: ""Qul ya ayyuhal kafirun"" parho, phir is ke khatam par so jao, kyun ke yeh shirk se baraat hai."
